.idea/*
charts/mlrun-ce/charts/*
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.DS_Store
**/__pycache__
# Packaged chart tarballs (generated by make package)
charts/mlrun-ce/mlrun-ce-*.tgz
# MLRun project directories created by test scripts
otlp-pro/

# Claude Code local settings (machine-specific, not for commit)
.claude/settings.local.json

# Filled-in installer config (copied from scripts/ce-config.yaml.example).
# Unanchored, so it matches at any depth; ce-config.yaml.example is unaffected.
ce-config.yaml
# ...which also caught the test fixture, whose values are deliberately fake. Without this
# exception the golden config cases fail in CI with the file simply missing.
!tests/installer/fixtures/ce-config.yaml

# uv writes this whenever a command runs with scripts/ as the working directory, because
# the pyproject.toml there makes it look like a project. It is a byproduct, not the
# installer's lockfile — that is scripts/install.py.lock, from the PEP 723 metadata, and it
# is committed. pyproject.toml exists only so `uvx --from git+...` has an entry point.
scripts/uv.lock
.pytest_cache/
